CONTRACT NO. 7521

AMENDMENT TO
AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE CITY OF CHEYENNE
AND LARAMIE COUNTY
FOR ANIMAL CONTROL SERVICES
Pursuant to Paragraph 3 of the Agreement, the parties mutually agree to renew this
Agreement for additional one-year terms.  The County shall pay upon receipt of the City's invoice
for Animal Control expenses only, the monthly amount of ten thousand nine hundred dollars
($10,900) for each of the months of July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023. There are no other material
changes to the Agreement.

CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING

